    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "syR9g",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9150,
      "name": "Note3 F1 — The daily letter",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "fill": "#00000000",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hpP5W",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "content": "F1 — The daily letter",
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X1hhH",
          "name": "s",
          "fill": "#B8860B",
          "content": "Print, not app",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LVTfz",
          "name": "b",
          "fill": "#444444",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Serif (Lora), roman-numeral dateline between gold rules, a diamond ornament, an outlined gold button instead of a filled one, and a reflective question under the verse. The bookmark ribbon at the bottom is the resume feature, styled as a page marker.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bKqki",
          "name": "v",
          "fill": "#777777",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Strongest brand fit — gold on black already reads as a leather-bound Bible. Slowest, most contemplative. Weakest at surfacing progress or discovery.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "XjpTP",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 9150,
      "name": "Note3 F2 — Journey map",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "fill": "#00000000",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iBNQN",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "content": "F2 — Journey map",
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "I2SVc",
          "name": "s",
          "fill": "#B8860B",
          "content": "Where am I, not what's new",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wV7dP",
          "name": "b",
          "fill": "#444444",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The learning path becomes an actual trail: completed nodes gold, current node indigo and larger, locked nodes dim. The gold segment of the path is literally how far you have come. The verse is a waypoint card below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pphaO",
          "name": "v",
          "fill": "#777777",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Most engaging and most novel. Makes the paths feature the point of the app. Risk: only works once a path is started, so it needs a real empty state.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
