          "type": "text",
          "id": "JoQEb",
          "name": "b",
          "fill": "#444444",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tiles of deliberately different sizes and fills: a tall indigo verse tile, a gold streak tile, a rhythm ring, a wide resume tile, and two small tiles for review and the meeting. Nothing is a full-width stripe.",
